      55.15,
      478.15,
      297.13,
      645.22
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, hereby declare under the Sub section (1) of the Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land mentioned below is needed for a public Purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act. All that allotment of land described as follows depicted in the Advance Tracing No. MAHA/HRS/2023/384 dated 20.07.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Uduwawala (a part), in No. 417 Uduwawala West Grama Niladhari Division, , in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Harispattuwa, in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
